d 'SRCTAG': module to stamp variables with source lineage and search it
d
d  srctag records where each variable came from (source, vintage,
d notes, agency, dataset, URL, category) in variable
d characteristics, which survive save, merge, and append. It
d refuses to overwrite an existing tag unless told to, keeps a
d dataset-level list of sources, and can sign the data so stale
d tags are detected. The companion command srcfind searches these
d tags in memory or across a folder of .dta files, audits for
d untagged variables, and exports every tag as a dataset that
d srctag apply can read back after review. A test battery ships as
d an ancillary file. 
d
d KW: provenance; data lineage; metadata; characteristics; documentation; data management
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261127
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Texas 2036
d Support: email eric.a.booth@@gmail.com
d
d Author: Elizabeth Teas, Far Harbor, LLC
d Support: email elizabeth@@farharbor.com
d
f srcfind.ado
f srctag.ado
f srcfind.sthlp
f srctag.sthlp
f ../t/test_srctag.do
